026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴列卡诺1-0斯特拉斯堡占据晋级先机 阿莱芒头球制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260501/zhanbao_image_1968864_1777582053_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260501/zhanbao_image_1968864_1777582053_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260501/zhanbao_image_1968864_1777582053_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>阿莱芒破门，巴列卡诺1-0斯特拉斯堡，占据晋级先机。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f39a4e7e1a0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">因凡蒂诺：伊朗将参加2026世界杯，并在美国踢小组赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.11" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010208182320.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.11" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.11" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010208182320.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010208182320.jpg"> </div><p>国际足联代表正在大会上，因凡蒂诺在开幕致辞中表示，伊朗将参加2026世界杯，并且将在美国参加小组赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f3cb1ac4b84native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">因凡蒂诺称伊朗将参加世界杯，特朗普：如果他这么说了我也同意</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010535531463.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010535531463.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010535531463.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f39a4e7e1a0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">因凡蒂诺在国际足联大会上表示，伊朗一定会在美国参加今夏世界杯</a>。美国总统特朗普对此进行了回应，称同意让伊朗参赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f39157c142bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：皇马是否聘请穆帅决定权在老佛爷 克洛普需先表明意向</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/6969c8e9aedfc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/6969c8e9aedfc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260116/6969c8e9aedfc.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺更新视频，谈到了近期皇马与穆里尼奥、克洛普的热门话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f37e9ebaf0bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">尘埃落定！德天空：40岁诺伊尔愿与拜仁续约，拜仁开出合同到2027</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.84" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010010317054.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.84" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.84" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010010317054.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010010317054.jpg"> </div><p>记者Florian Plettenberg消息，诺伊尔希望与拜仁完成续约。拜仁已为他开出一份至2027年到期的全新合同。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f3820b701cbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">都是谣言！阿斯：克洛普不是皇马主帅候选人，他正等待执掌德国队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250115/678767f3be042.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250115/678767f3be042.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250115/678767f3be042.jpg"> </div><p>据《阿斯报》报道，克洛普无缘皇马主帅席位，他正静待德国国家队主帅的职位。在那之前，他将继续履职红牛集团体育总监。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f385e413c59native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗：球员应为抨击裁判抹黑联赛受到处罚；沉默数周后我该开口了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.59" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010442203993.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010442203993.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010442203993.jpg"> </div><p>C罗接受了费迪南德的采访，对近期沙特联争议话题发表了自己的看法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f3cdb91a57dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安东尼：C罗在桑拿房展示身材问我像不像23岁，我当时都有些惭愧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010557578971.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010557578971_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260501/202605010557578971_720.jpg"> </div><p>安东尼在接受环球体育独家专访时，爆料了自己效力曼联期间与C罗的幕后日常。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f389d667992native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西媒：巴萨今夏想签中锋、边锋、中卫，还有意31岁皇社门将雷米罗</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260119/696e451ec240e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260119/696e451ec240e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260119/696e451ec240e.jpg"> </div><p>《塞尔电台》消息，巴萨对皇家社会31岁的门将雷米罗表达了兴趣，但雷米罗尚未决定自己的未来。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-30/69f3703e80e58native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不会接受手术！ESPN：巴西已基本排除埃斯特旺参加世界杯可能性</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e8d9f6ccf8e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e8d9f6ccf8e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260422/69e8d9f6ccf8e.jpg"> </div><p>据ESPN巴西版记者Bruno Andrade透露，巴西足协实际上已经排除埃斯特旺参加世界杯的可能性。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f39197a333cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：戈登今夏离队可能极其大，他是拜仁边锋引援3大目标之一</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260219/69963fd1042b2.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260219/69963fd1042b2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260219/69963fd1042b2.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺在今日个人播客节目中爆料称，纽卡边锋戈登是拜仁今夏补强边锋位置的三名候选之一。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f395230fc2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：巴萨坚持要求曼联重新谈拉什福德转会费，也愿再租借一年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d184e2832a3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d184e2832a3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260405/69d184e2832a3.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺在今日个人播客节目中爆料称，巴萨和曼联就拉什福德转会费买断金额的肥皂剧仍在继续。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f3a5ab8ba27native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：巴萨与若昂·佩德罗进行非正式接触，切尔西不会轻易放人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250709/686da4f39769f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250709/686da4f39769f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250709/686da4f39769f.jpg"> </div><p>据巴西ESPN报道，巴萨有意切尔西前锋若昂·佩德罗，他们已经进行了初步非正式接触。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-01/69f38a1654e55native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">泰晤士：赛后称球迷影响裁判判罚，赖斯可能被欧足联处罚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251216/694032f316446.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inlin